 "closes": "The district\u2019s circuit breaker revolving fund cashbook for the year, which shows what the receipt was actually spent on \u2014 already the named remedy in `money-gaps.csv`. For the in-district question, Schedule 19 of the End of Year Financial Report as filed, which lists each grant and revolving fund separately.",
